  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEABLUE - JSB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, developed in consultation with the Ministry of Marine Affairs and Fisheries (MoMAF) and Japan International Cooperation Agency (JICA), addresses the pressing development challenges facing Indonesia&#x2019;s fisheries sector, particularly small-scale fishers, exacerbated by poverty, climate vulnerability, inadequate infrastructure, marine pollution, and IUU. The industry suffers from declining fish stocks, insufficient access to markets, and limited adoption of sustainable practices, which disproportionately impact coastal communities and women who play a critical role in this sector.</narrative>
  </description>
